-- "a b a b a": its suffixes in order are a, aba, ababa, ba, baba; in text order ababa shares 3 with aba,
-- baba 2 with ba, aba 1 with a, ba 0 with ababa, and a has no predecessor
kasai-example : k-lens (kasai-ms (tokenize "a b a b a")) ≡ cons #3 (cons #2 (cons #1 (cons #0 nil)))
kasai-example = λ i → cons #3 (cons #2 (cons #1 (cons #0 nil)))
